,{"type":"text","text":" cost matrix (scipy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"linear_sum_assignment"},{"type":"text","text":", the same assignment): min(rowCount, columnCount) pairs, no row or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"column twice, least total cost (greatest with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maximize"},{"type":"text","text":"). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cost(row, column)"},{"type":"text","text":" is nil for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forbidden pair. nil when no assignment avoids the forbidden pairs. A matrix with more rows than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"columns is solved transposed, as scipy does. O(r² c) time, r ≤ c the dimensions, and O(r c)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"memory: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cost"},{"type":"text","text":" is called once per cell, into a matrix, as scipy takes one. Integer costs are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exact (scipy converts to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"url":"\/documentation\/matchingmodule\/linearsumassignment(rowcount:columncount:maximize:cost:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatchingModule\/documentation\/MatchingModule\/linearSumAssignment(rowCount:columnCount:maximize:cost:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"linearSumAssignment","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"rowCount","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"columnCount","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maximize","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentif